  "title": "Ash-e-jow (Iranian/Persian Barley Soup)",
  "description": "I've seen a lot of recipes for this soup; however, my mother-in-law adds tomato paste for a bit of a different flavour and she doesn't add any lentils or beans. It's thick, filling, and delicious, and you could make it vegetarian by using vegetable stock.",
  "authors": [
    "Autumn Leaves"
  ],
